#. type: Content of: <div><div><div><div><div><div><div><h1>
msgid "Tor: powered by you"
msgstr "Tor: sostenido por ti"

#. type: Content of: <div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p>
msgid ""
"Unlike Big Tech, Tor doesn&#39;t sell your data to make money. Instead, "
"6,490 donors every year keep Tor strong. Join the movement with a donation "
"today!"
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de las grandes multinacionales tecnológicas, Tor no se "
"enriquece vendiendo tus datos, sino que 6.490 donantes cada año nos apoyan. "
"Únete hoy mismo con una donación!"

#. type: Content of: <div><div><div><div><div><div><div>
msgid ""
"<a class=\"btn\" id=\"yec-donate-button\" href=\"https://www.torproject.org/"
"donate/yec2026-tails-banner-en\"> <span>Donate now</span> [[!img nav/year-"
"end/arrow_up_right.svg link=\"no\" class=\"donate-arrow img-svg\" alt=\"\"]] "
"</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"btn\" id=\"yec-donate-button\" href=\"https://www.torproject.org/"
"donate/yec2026-tails-banner-es\"> <span>Dona ahora</span> [[!img nav/year-"
"end/arrow_up_right.svg link=\"no\" class=\"donate-arrow img-svg\" alt=\"\"]] "
"</a>"

